### planrisk: 4 high, 1 medium, 1 low

**Plan:** 6 to create, 4 to update, 0 to replace, 0 to delete, 2 to move · Terraform 1.16.1

| Severity | Resource | Finding | Rule |
|---|---|---|---|
| **high** | `aws_iam_policy.admin` | policy grants full "\*:\*" administrative privileges ("Action": "\*" on "Resource": "\*") | `iam-wildcard` |
| **high** | `aws_s3_bucket_policy.data` | policy grants access to everyone with "Principal": "\*" | `iam-wildcard` |
| **high** | `aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block.data` | turns off S3 Block Public Access: block\_public\_policy, restrict\_public\_buckets | `s3-public-access` |
| **high** | `aws_vpc_security_group_ingress_rule.ssh` | allows ingress from ::/0 to port 22 (tcp) | `sg-open-ingress` |
| **medium** | `aws_lb.public` | load balancer may be internet-facing (internal is only known after apply; it defaults to false, which is internet-facing) | `public-endpoint` |
| **low** | `aws_iam_role_policy.app` | policy is only known after apply, so it wasn't checked | `iam-wildcard` |

